OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor suspended from
OL,4,Aprison job after 'despicable' comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This report contains racist
OL,7,Fand offensive language.
OL,9,FA Reform UK councillor who was filmed
OL,10,Fcalling Asian homeowners "parasites"
OL,11,Fhas been suspended from his job with
OL,12,Fthe prison service.
OL,14,FAlan Feeney is the deputy mayor of
OL,15,FSolihull, and in July his register of
OL,16,Finterests with the council recorded he
OL,17,Fwas employed as a custodial manager at
OL,18,FHMP Birmingham.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
