OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor suspended from
OL,4,Aprison job after 'despicable' comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Justice called the
OL,7,Fcomments, filmed in an ITV News
OL,8,Finvestigation, "despicable", and said
OL,9,Fthey were "entirely at odds" with the
OL,10,Fstandards expected of prison staff.
